ens scraping for basic occupation and acknowledgment.   \n  \nCue Yuuki Wakura, a domestically crafty and laborious high school senior whose older sister was taken during a Mato event 5 years before; while lamenting the hardships of the life ahead of him, an event opens before him, and while being rescued from demons by Captain Kyouka of the Anti-Demon Corps, she confers him powers as her \"slave\" and turns him into a mighty beast mount that mows down the demons.   \n  \nHowever, there is a surprising price to pay for being her \"slave\"... and it's not him who has to pay it.","year":2019,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":["Sci-Fi","Action","Romance","Comedy","Drama"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/e1e38166-20e4-4468-9370-187f985c550e/bee3f8c8-9b7d-4523-b78e-881a50311de5.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["ru","es-la","id","pl","zh-hk","pt-br","en","fr","vi","tr","uk","jv"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.94,"follows":225844,"listAt":"2026-10-31T05:52:38.375Z","chapters":[{"id":"ac68cc3e-1336-4492-aa5f-02a5f7297c46","number":"188","volume":null,"title":"Kebetulan","lang":"id","pages":21,"createdAt":"2026-10-05T02:12:28+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"2ec5b1d8-59bf-4443-be2a-8b5c6555f989","number":"187","volume":null,"title":"Perasaan Yang Tercurah","lang":"id","pages":21,"createdAt":"2026-09-20T03:14:49+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"e9e9fc27-92d8-4aaa-8b6a-3772ea46c5b9","number":"186","volume":null,"title":"Pertemuan Enam Dewa","lang":"id","pages":20,"createdAt":"2026-09-06T00:12:35+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"25b55362-b02e-4f06-9b85-bb84fc98c708","number":"186","volume":null,"title":"Pertemuan Enam Dewa","lang":"id","pages":19,"createdAt":"2026-09-05T03:00:14+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"fcbf64d2-154c-4e46-831c-ddf9f6b5e916","number":"185","volume":null,"title":"Membungkuk","lang":"id","pages":24,"createdAt":"2026-08-23T03:09:46+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"1633d399-859a-4012-8822-8f9f7fb32427","numb